                "message": "🔧 Show the author works report in the shared batch report buffer\n\nsp-author-notes-bibtex opened a special-mode buffer, so it had no\norg-like look, no d/u/b/k keys and no echo-area hints.  It now uses an\nsp-batch-report-mode derived mode, with its own o, c and C keys added\nthrough sp-batch-report-extra-hints.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAF6gJZsaMTJLEA9cM",
